      "source": "Returns whether the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a> describes an input property for the projection, i.e. a\nproperty that needs to be present on the source to be able to create reasonable projections for the type the\ndescriptor was looked up on.",
      "translation": "返回给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a> 是否描述了投影的输入属性，即为了能够为所查找描述符的类型创建合理的投影，该属性必须存在于源对象中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the properties that will be consumed by the projection type.",
      "translation": "返回将由投影类型消耗的属性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
